cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you write about or build on Jason AI GTM Harness, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Jason AI GTM Harness"
abstract: >-
  An open-source AI SDR by Reply.io that runs inside the AI agent you already use
  (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor CLI, GitHub Copilot CLI, Gemini CLI or Antigravity CLI).
  A durable local runtime with nine specialist roles plans a line of contact for each
  person, writes and sends cold email and LinkedIn messages through a provider, reads
  the replies and follows up, with every message waiting for a person's approval until
  that person chooses otherwise.
authors:
